#. type: Title =
#: en/epn/modules/ROOT/pages/establishing-a-node.adoc:1
#: en/nodes/modules/ROOT/pages/establishing-a-node.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Engaging stakeholders towards establishing a node"
msgstr "吸引利害關係人以建立節點"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/epn/modules/ROOT/pages/establishing-a-node.adoc:10
#: en/nodes/modules/ROOT/pages/establishing-a-node.adoc:10
msgid "Identify and prioritize stakeholders in your country/economy that play a role in joining GBIF as a Participant."
msgstr "識別並按優先順序排列你的國家／經濟體中，對加入GBIF成為參與者，扮演重要角色的利害關係人。"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/epn/modules/ROOT/pages/establishing-a-node.adoc:11
#: en/nodes/modules/ROOT/pages/establishing-a-node.adoc:11
msgid "Prepare and deliver a pitch for joining GBIF as a Participant."
msgstr "準備並發表一份關於以「參與者」身分加入 GBIF 的簡報。"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/epn/modules/ROOT/pages/establishing-a-node.adoc:12
#: en/nodes/modules/ROOT/pages/establishing-a-node.adoc:12
msgid "Define the scope of a Node for your country/economy to include necessary infrastructure and resources."
msgstr "為你的國家／經濟體的「節點」界定範圍，使其涵蓋必要的基礎設施與資源。"

#. type: Block title
#: en/epn/modules/ROOT/pages/establishing-a-node.adoc:15
#: en/nodes/modules/ROOT/pages/establishing-a-node.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Node Managers and Secretariat staff at the Global Nodes Training, Canberra, Australia 2023."
msgstr "2023 年於澳洲坎培拉舉行的「全球節點培訓」活動中的各節點經理與秘書處工作人員。"

